{"3481710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Sleeping Girlfriend", "steam_appid": 3481710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you protect her… or will you be the next one needing help?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What seemed like the beginning of a perfect life together soon turns into a terrifying reality that feels impossible to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;My Sleeping Girlfriend&quot;</strong> is a <strong>psychological horror game</strong> where you take on the role of a young man who, after moving in with his girlfriend, uncovers a dark secret: her seemingly harmless sleepwalking hides something truly terrifying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for her</strong> in the darkness of a house that feels more hostile with each passing night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe her carefully</strong>—every step, every movement could be a warning… or a trap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make quick decisions</strong> to prevent something terrible from happening. Her safety is in your hands… but so is your own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is what it seems, and your actions each night could mean the difference between a bad dream… and a true nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you do when the real horror isn’t her… but yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠ <strong><i>Content Warning: </i></strong><i>This game contains <strong>violent scenes, disturbing images, and unsettling moments</strong>, which may not be suitable for all players.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you protect her… or will you be the next one needing help?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What seemed like the beginning o